pan></p>\n<p style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Phone: +1 (800) 913-9932</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;\"> </span></p>\n<h2 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;\">Frequently Asked Questions about Zumareel Bait Casting Reel for Bass Fishing</span></strong></h2>\n<h3 class=\"MsoNormal\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;\">What Makes Zumareel Ideal for Bass Fishing?</span></strong></em></h3>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;\">High-speed retrieve, powerful drag system, and precision casting are features helping Zumareel to effectively fight aggressive bass in different conditions. </span></p>\n<h3 class=\"MsoNormal\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;\">How does the Magnetic System on Bait Casting Work for Bass Fishing?</span></strong></em></h3>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;\">Magnets are used to apply resistance to the spool during casting preventing backlashes by controlling spool’s change in rotation in different environments or weather conditions.</span></p>\n<h3 class=\"MsoNormal\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;\">Is Zumareel Suitable for Anglers New to Bait Casting?</span></strong></em></h3>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;\">Despite needing some learning curves, Zumareel design comes with adjustable magnetic braking system making more forgiving when drawing the catch in.</span></p>\n<h3 class=\"MsoNormal\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;\">What Type of Fishing Line is Recommended when Using Zumareel?</span></strong></em></h3>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;\">Zumareel is versatile with braided lines often the preference due to sensitivity and overall strength. Fluorocarbon and monofilament lines are also compatible. </span></p>\n<h3 class=\"MsoNormal\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;\">Is Maintenance of Zumareel Easy?</span></strong></em></h3>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;\">To guarantee long-lasting performance, regularly rinsing with fresh water after every use is highly recommended. Regular cleaning and lubrication of the bearings and gears helps maintain smooth operations. </span>    </p>",
